04/22", weight="64", tooltip="NEIRA Boys Fours, Pomfret v. Berkshire, Middletown			
Distance: 1500M Conditions: 9 MPH tailwind, occasional gusts of ~16 MPH. Light chop, more prevalent in the second 750. Comments: Pomfret Boys raced down. Pomfret racing should not be used for NEIRA seeding.
Alternated races with Girls. Order of boys' races: B3, B2, B1, B4/Novice.
